{"hits": {"hits": [{"metadata": {"authors": [{"full_name": "Luo, Ma"}, {"full_name": "Qiu, Jian-wei"}, {"full_name": "Sterman, George F."}], "publication_info": [{"journal_volume": "49", "page_end": "4502", "year": 1994, "page_start": "4493", "journal_title": "Phys.Rev.D"}], "texkeys": ["Luo:1993ui"], "abstracts": [{"value": "We analyze anomalous nuclear enhancement in the photoproduction of jets as a higher-twist process in perturbative QCD. We use the Fermilab E683 data on dijet momentum imbalance to estimate the size of the relevant twist-4 parton distributions. We find that twist-4 matrix elements are of the order of 0.05-0.1 GeV2 times typical twist-2 parton distributions. We discuss a physical interpretation of the nuclear enhancement as a measure of the average net transverse color force on an off-shell parton moving through nuclear matter, and give an order-of-magnitude estimate for the typical squared transverse field strengths encountered by a fast moving parton."}], "control_number": 35913, "dois": [{"value": "10.1103/PhysRevD.49.4493"}], "titles": [{"title": "Twist four nuclear parton distributions from photoproduction"}], "author_count": 3, "document_type": ["article"]}, "id": "35913", "created": "1993-09-29T00:00:00+00:00", "updated": "2023-03-09T18:27:42.807502+00:00", "links": {"bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/35913?format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/35913?format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/35913?format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/35913?format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/35913?format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/35913?format=cv", "citations": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A35913"}}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=j%20Phys.Rev.D%2C49%2C4493&size=3&page=1&fields=control_number,titles.title,